Package: lingmo-style
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Lingmo Desktop - Qt Widgets Style
 Lingmo Style provides a QProxyStyle-based Qt Widgets style implementation
 for the Lingmo Desktop environment. It reads design tokens from lingmo-theme
 and ensures that Qt Widgets applications share the same visual design as
 QML applications.

Package: lingmo-style-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: lingmo-style (= ${binary:Version}),
         liblingmotheme-dev (>= 1.0),
         qt6-base-dev (>= 6.5),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Lingmo Desktop - Qt Widgets Style (development files)
 This package contains the development headers and CMake integration
 for Lingmo Style.
